  exerciseTitle: Walk Quest not working
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459482
  exerciseText: Walk 50 Meters Quest is not working
  hintText: Add logs to see where the code is stopping, what part of it isn't running?
    Is the quest starting?
  solutionText: OnUpdate event on the PlayerInteractionSystem is not being fired,
    therefore the Quest never adds progress.
